  "details": "https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-performance-ranking-system/\n\nSDK 3.10.3 was released on April 16, 2026, but there was no associated documentation about how many VRC Raycast components can be used on an avatar.\n\nI did some personal testing with avatar SDK 3.10.3 in Unity Editor to find out.\n\nWindows limits (maximum):\n\n- Excellent: 1 (Windows)\n\n- Good: 4 (Windows)\n\n- Medium: 8 (Windows)\n\n- Poor: 15 (Windows, sic!)\n\nMobile limits (maximum):\n\n- Excellent: 1 (Mobile)\n\n- Good: 2 (Mobile)\n\n- Medium: 4 (Mobile)\n\n- Poor: 8 (Mobile)\n\nRecommended: 1, for all platforms. The absolute max limit in the SDK 3.10.3 is 80 (VRCRaycast + FinalIK) on all platforms.\n\nPlease document this in the VRChat Creation docs, above.",
